※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4206 LANG_TYPE_OPERAND_MISMATCH

※ Both sides of a comparison have one type, as both sides of every other
※ operator do.  A literal without a suffix takes the type of the other side;
※ two named types that differ do not meet in the middle.
let narrow: u8 = 1u8
let wide: u16 = 2u16

@[startup]
fn main() → bool:
    narrow < wide
